Plan: bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb   Fetched: <fetched>
Totals include the Archera premium. The API reports no currency, so amounts are unlabelled.
This comparison covers the whole Archera plan. It is not mapped onto CUDly recommendation rows or recommendation CSV output.
A plan comparison is a hypothetical rollup, never a bindable insurance quote, and never a purchase. An insured target of 100% is a requested target subject to Archera underwriting allowances, not a guarantee. The API exposes no per-line product support or allowance verdict, so product support and allowance are shown as unknown unless Archera's documentation says otherwise.

